* ''Tabs carry live sessions; one face per session comes later'' (operator, 2026-11-05: //"Multiple tabs will carry live sessions, and later can change face (ONE FACE per session later on the roadmap)."//): each tab holds its own unlocked session now; the face a session wears changes by the recorded switch act on the road's later `ONE FACE` stride. The slice design rests in `pono/browser-vessel-lift` on its lane.

